Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,An Urban Agglomeration\Nis a continuous urban
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,spread made of a town and\Nits adjoining outgrowths,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,or contiguous towns. Why does this matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because during leave,\Ndeputation abroad, training
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,or suspension, your House\NRent Allowance depends
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,on retaining a house at the same station.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.59,0:00:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,These two definitions decide what counts.
